			"text": "A physical clock (also called wall-clock time) is the real-world time maintained by a\nmachine’s hardware clock, typically expressed as:\n\nYYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS",
			"rawText": "A physical clock (also called wall-clock time) is the real-world time maintained by a machine’s hardware clock, typically expressed as:\n\nYYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS",
