		},
		{
			"id": "JT9CJH2E",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -216.25,
			"y": 375.6640625,
			"width": 495,
			"height": 550,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
			"fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "aE",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 390795046,
			"version": 58,
			"versionNonce": 858828966,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1772654104788,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "When a machine syncs time with a time server:\n\nIt sends request\nServer replies with current time\nNetwork delay exists\n\nBut:\n\nWe don’t know exact one-way delay\nWe only know round-trip time\nSo clock adjustment is an approximation.\n\nexample:\nClient asks time.\nRound trip = 40 ms.\nAssumes 20 ms one way.\n\nBut actual:\nOutgoing: 10 ms\nReturn: 30 ms\n\nClock is now 10 ms wrong.",
			"rawText": "When a machine syncs time with a time server:\n\nIt sends request\nServer replies with current time\nNetwork delay exists\n\nBut:\n\nWe don’t know exact one-way delay\nWe only know round-trip time\nSo clock adjustment is an approximation.\n\nexample:\nClient asks time.\nRound trip = 40 ms.\nAssumes 20 ms one way.\n\nBut actual:\nOutgoing: 10 ms\nReturn: 30 ms\n\nClock is now 10 ms wrong.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "YdlE21b_ICnFZh7CobnRy",
			"originalText": "When a machine syncs time with a time server:\n\nIt sends request\nServer replies with current time\nNetwork delay exists\n\nBut:\n\nWe don’t know exact one-way delay\nWe only know round-trip time\nSo clock adjustment is an approximation.\n\nexample:\nClient asks time.\nRound trip = 40 ms.\nAssumes 20 ms one way.\n\nBut actual:\nOutgoing: 10 ms\nReturn: 30 ms\n\nClock is now 10 ms wrong.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
