			"updated": 1772700717905,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "\nWhen synchronizing using Network Time Protocol (NTP):\n\nIf system clock is ahead,\nNTP may adjust time backward.\n\nExample:\n\nCurrent time → 10:00:10\nNTP correction → set to 10:00:05",
			"rawText": "\nWhen synchronizing using Network Time Protocol (NTP):\n\nIf system clock is ahead,\nNTP may adjust time backward.\n\nExample:\n\nCurrent time → 10:00:10\nNTP correction → set to 10:00:05",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "8xPCRi8g",
			"originalText": "\nWhen synchronizing using Network Time Protocol (NTP):\n\nIf system clock is ahead,\nNTP may adjust time backward.\n\nExample:\n\nCurrent time → 10:00:10\nNTP correction → set to 10:00:05",
