			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1773381409987,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "WHERE WE USE PHYSICAL CLOCKS?\n\n1. Logging & Monitoring\nELK stack\nObservability systems\n\n\n2. TTL (Time-To-Live)\nCache expiry\nSession expiry\nToken expiration\n\nExample:\nRedis keys\nJWT tokens\n\n3. Rate Limiting\n\nExample:\n100 requests per minute\nUses wall clock time",
			"rawText": "WHERE WE USE PHYSICAL CLOCKS?\n\n1. Logging & Monitoring\nELK stack\nObservability systems\n\n\n2. TTL (Time-To-Live)\nCache expiry\nSession expiry\nToken expiration\n\nExample:\nRedis keys\nJWT tokens\n\n3. Rate Limiting\n\nExample:\n100 requests per minute\nUses wall clock time",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "t0APO4xe",
			"originalText": "WHERE WE USE PHYSICAL CLOCKS?\n\n1. Logging & Monitoring\nELK stack\nObservability systems\n\n\n2. TTL (Time-To-Live)\nCache expiry\nSession expiry\nToken expiration\n\nExample:\nRedis keys\nJWT tokens\n\n3. Rate Limiting\n\nExample:\n100 requests per minute\nUses wall clock time",
